Question:
List the appropriate HTML input types you would use for each of the five fields. Explain how you would use HTML5 built-in validation attributes to enforce the two constraints mentioned, and why these attributes alone are not sufficient for production-level validation.


Answer:

Field	Input Type
Applicant Name	text
Email	email
Phone Number	tel
Preferred Domain	select
Resume	file

Validation Attributes:

required → Ensures no field is empty.
type="email" → Accepts only valid email format.

Why not enough?
HTML validation can be bypassed, so server-side validation is also required for security.